step_id: G-002
name: Model Profiles, Configuration, and VRAM Facts
description: Define model and hardware profiles, runtime configuration 
  ownership, resident-service baseline measurement, loaded-model VRAM facts, the
  dynamic VRAM pool, calibration feedback, and the KV-cache byte formulas that 
  convert model/runtime profile parameters into memory facts used by later 
  admission decisions.
